            "sid": "ISA 46:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bel boweth down, Nebo stoopeth, their idols were upon the beasts, and upon the cattle: your carriages",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "were",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.46.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.46.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "heavy loaden;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "they are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.46.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.46.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a burden to the weary",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "beast",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.46.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.46.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 46:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They stoop, they bow down together; they could not deliver the burden, but themselves are gone into captivity.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
