          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ To whom will ye liken me, and make",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "me",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.46.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.46.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "equal, and compare me, that we may be like?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 46:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They lavish gold out of the bag, and weigh silver in the balance,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.46.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.46.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hire a goldsmith; and he maketh it a god: they fall down, yea, they worship.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 46:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They bear him upon the shoulder, they carry him, and set him in his place, and he standeth; from his place shall he not remove: yea,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "one",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.46.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.46.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shall cry unto him, yet can he not answer, nor save him out of his trouble.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 46:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Remember this, and shew yourselves men: bring",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.46.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.46.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "again to mind, O ye transgressors.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 46:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Remember the former things of old: for I",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "am",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.46.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.46.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "God, and",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "there is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.46.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.46.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "none else;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "I am",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.46.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.46.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "God, and",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "there is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.46.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.46.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "none like me,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 46:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Declaring the end from the beginning, and from ancient times",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "the things",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.46.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.46.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "that are not",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "yet",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.46.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.46.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "done, saying, My counsel shall stand, and I will do all my pleasure:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 46:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Calling a ravenous bird from the east, the man that executeth my counsel from a far country: yea, I have spoken",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.46.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.46.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", I will also bring it to pass; I have purposed",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.46.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.46.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", I will also do it.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
